  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "又哭了？这盘棋输了，眼泪比棋子掉得还快。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 5690,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5690,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "先别急着哄。",
      "chars": 6,
      "speech_ms": 1210,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 6090,
      "end_ms": 7300,
      "trace_id": "0747c87e4631bbf9b373fd43345dc2e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "难过可以，眼泪也可以流，可棋子不能摔，棋盘不能推——先把棋子收好，收棋，就是认这盘的结果。",
      "chars": 45,
      "speech_ms": 10180,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 7800,
      "end_ms": 17980,
      "trace_id": "0747c881ea44891e1c3b01e8bc8cc1db"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "可他说，爷爷故意赢他，不跟他玩了。",
      "chars": 17,
      "speech_ms": 3660,
      "pause_after_ms": 300,
      "start_ms": 18480,
      "end_ms": 22140,
      "trace_id": "0747c8834b44c6022e23cc3764f2a000"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "我要是故意让，他赢十盘也学不会。",
      "chars": 16,
      "speech_ms": 2790,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 22440,
      "end_ms": 25230,
      "trace_id": "0747d0b20fd278cfaf5963f248208da3 (重配版)"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "孙子，听好：下棋跟过日子一样，输了先认，不摔、不赖、不笑话人。",
      "chars": 31,
      "speech_ms": 8100,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "start_ms": 25630,
      "end_ms": 33730,
      "trace_id": "0747c8895142940f6cbdcca3accde026"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "那下次呢？",
      "chars": 5,
      "speech_ms": 990,
      "pause_after_ms": 300,
      "start_ms": 34330,
      "end_ms": 35320,
      "trace_id": "0747c88b8c58615dcfe03ea2f7795e40"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "下次开局前先说好三条：不摔棋子，不许悔棋，赢了不笑话人。",
      "chars": 28,
      "speech_ms": 7150,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 35620,
      "end_ms": 42770,
      "trace_id": "0747c88edf9c988fc42475f286ef07c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "做不到，今天就不下了。",
      "chars": 11,
      "speech_ms": 2080,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 43170,
      "end_ms": 45250,
      "trace_id": "0747c8906101b3a0d878aaa2bf1e000a"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "行，规矩说在前面，比输了再讲道理管用。",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 4030,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 45750,
      "end_ms": 49780,
      "trace_id": "0747c89399b1a2fa1ef81ec5dddb9713"
    },
    {
      "id": "A11",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "等他心平了，再陪他看看这盘输在哪一步。",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 3820,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "start_ms": 50180,
      "end_ms": 54000,
      "trace_id": "0747c8963d60338a068ddb2e294ce19f"
    }
  ]
}